        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Status:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;light-dark(#14532d, #68d391)&quot;&gt;Green = ready within this draft.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;light-dark(#175fa8, #79b8ff)&quot;&gt;Blue = in progress.&lt;/font&gt; Grey = waiting, paused or complete; see label.&lt;br&gt;Readiness does not authorize execution, research, agent assignment or spending. Card approval does not approve the overall plan.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Arrows:&lt;/b&gt; Solid = prerequisite to finish the next result. Dashed = helpful input; the destination can start without it. Line crossings do not join.&lt;br&gt;SP = subject prompt; MP = mask prompt. Agents implement; user directs and reviews. Assignments remain open. Status is not a live feed." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=light-dark(#45566c, #bac6d3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56.8" y="2406.5" width="2178.4" height="97.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="open" value="&lt;b&gt;Still open:&lt;/b&gt; release subset/size · quality judgments · training volume · annotation handling · model choices · measurement procedures · budget · hosting · assignments.&lt;br&gt;This is a planning draft, not a handoff or authorization to start work. Vast.ai training, snapshot GPU work, hosting and reruns share the $1,000 lifetime cap." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=light-dark(#fff7e6, #332d24);strokeColor=light-dark(#e2c88f, #7c8da1);align=left;spacing=14;fontSize=14;fontColor=light-dark(#6a5330, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56.8" y="2523.5" width="2178.4" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
