        <mxCell id="week-subtitle" value="Overall plan not approved · Training data ready for fine-tuning: target September 27 · Schedule feasibility remains unproven&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;light-dark(#6b7788, #bac6d3)&quot;&gt;04 · Mask prominence: mask prompt finished; resumption not confirmed.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontColor=light-dark(#45566c, #bac6d3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="90" width="1600" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Week 1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fix prompts; build 100-note hierarchy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Subject and mask prompts finished.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;100-note hierarchy generation underway; review pending.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inspect category choices, narrowing and relevant notes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;light-dark(#6b7788, #bac6d3)&quot;&gt;Map: 01–02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#f4f7fc, #303c49);strokeColor=light-dark(#b7c8e0, #7c8da1);align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontSize=16;fontColor=light-dark(#1e334d, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="160" width="310" height="480" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Week 2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Broader hierarchy + model pilots&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;200 notes / 2 topics → 300 / 3 → 500 / 5.&lt;br&gt;Continue mask prominence; test at 500.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Compare training-data generators and models to fine-tune.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Training data target: Sept 27.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Needs 500-note validation, generator and volume decisions.&lt;br&gt;Start stage measurements (22).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;light-dark(#6b7788, #bac6d3)&quot;&gt;Map: 03–07, 17, 20–22&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#f7f5fb, #303c49);strokeColor=light-dark(#cbbfdd, #7c8da1);align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontSize=16;fontColor=light-dark(#1e334d, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="385" y="160" width="310" height="480" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Week 3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fine-tune the mask/prominence model&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Train on Vast.ai; check unseen-note masks/prominence and runtime.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Prepare model files, usage instructions and evaluation results. Verify loading and generation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Needs selected model + suitable data.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Data target: September 27.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Volume and production time open.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;light-dark(#6b7788, #bac6d3)&quot;&gt;Map: 08&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#f7f5fb, #303c49);strokeColor=light-dark(#cbbfdd, #7c8da1);align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontSize=16;fontColor=light-dark(#1e334d, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="715" y="160" width="310" height="480" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week4" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Week 4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Build launch hierarchy snapshot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Use the fine-tuned model’s masks and prominence to build the launch hierarchy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Prepare runnable code + instructions, architecture and continual-update path matching the build.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Needs full-build feasibility and sample-hierarchy checks (10 + 11).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;light-dark(#6b7788, #bac6d3)&quot;&gt;Map: 12&lt;br&gt;Service/Notedeck: parallel track below.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#f1f8f6, #303c49);strokeColor=light-dark(#b1d0c5, #7c8da1);align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontSize=16;fontColor=light-dark(#1e334d, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1045" y="160" width="310" height="480" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week5" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Week 5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Verify and launch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deploy the public hierarchy service. Verify Notedeck browsing and fix integration/deployment problems.&lt;br&gt;First integration happens earlier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Publish the prepared model (08), full code and architecture (12), documentation and announcement.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;light-dark(#6b7788, #bac6d3)&quot;&gt;Map: 14–16&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#fcf7ee, #303c49);strokeColor=light-dark(#dac5a2, #7c8da1);align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontSize=16;fontColor=light-dark(#1e334d, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1375" y="160" width="310" height="480" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week-delivery" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#fcf7ee, #2c2620);strokeColor=light-dark(#dac5a2, #3d4958);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="675" width="1630" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week-delivery-heading" value="Parallel track · protocol, service and Notedeck" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=light-dark(#6a5330, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="75" y="690" width="1590" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week-delivery-note" value="Runs alongside hierarchy/model work. Exact dates remain open; positions are not week assignments." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=light-dark(#6a5330, #bac6d3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="75" y="725" width="1590" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week-protocol" value="&lt;b&gt;13 · Define Nostr hierarchy protocol&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Define requests/responses for categories and notes.&lt;br&gt;Does not wait for training data." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ffffff, #303c49);strokeColor=light-dark(#dac5a2, #7c8da1);align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=15;fontColor=light-dark(#1e334d, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="75" y="760" width="340" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week-service-client" value="&lt;b&gt;14 + 15 · Build service and Notedeck browser&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Service testing needs protocol (13) + the 100-note snapshot (02).&lt;br&gt;Notedeck can start with 13; integration needs 14.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Test browsing with the small hierarchy while model/data work continues." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ffffff, #303c49);strokeColor=light-dark(#dac5a2, #7c8da1);align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=15;fontColor=light-dark(#1e334d, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="455" y="760" width="740" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week-launch" value="&lt;b&gt;16 · Verify and launch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Verify service + Notedeck with the final snapshot (12).&lt;br&gt;Publish the model prepared in 08 and code, architecture and update path prepared in 12.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;October 18&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ffffff, #303c49);strokeColor=light-dark(#dac5a2, #7c8da1);align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=15;fontColor=light-dark(#1e334d, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1235" y="760" width="430" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week-protocol-integration" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=light-dark(#8c7756, #a5b4c5);strokeWidth=2;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="week-protocol" target="week-service-client"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week-integration-launch" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=light-dark(#8c7756, #a5b4c5);strokeWidth=2;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="week-service-client" target="week-launch"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="suggestion-heading" value="Approved scheduling changes" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=light-dark(#6a5330, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="985" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="suggestion1" value="&lt;b&gt;Test more topics while developing prominence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;After the good 100-note hierarchy, start 200/300-note builds alongside work on the mask-prominence prompt.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Complete the 500-note browsing and prominence check before bulk training-data generation. That also needs a training-data generator and an agreed volume." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#fff7e6, #332d24);strokeColor=light-dark(#e2c88f, #7c8da1);align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontSize=16;fontColor=light-dark(#6a5330, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="1045" width="530" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="suggestion2" value="&lt;b&gt;Start stage measurements in Week 2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;22: measure SSE, category titles and TRUE using existing masks and categories.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;20: combine with HDBSCAN requirements, fine-tuning pilot rates and mask/category/filtered-pair counts to inform launch size.&lt;br&gt;Per-pair TRUE cost is not total build cost." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#fff7e6, #332d24);strokeColor=light-dark(#e2c88f, #7c8da1);align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontSize=16;fontColor=light-dark(#6a5330, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="605" y="1045" width="530" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="suggestion4" value="&lt;b&gt;Choose the training-data generator before bulk labeling&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Compare models that generate subjects, masks and prominence for fine-tuning: quality, speed, cost and terms. Current work: Muse high vs Astra low; no model selected.&lt;br&gt;This is separate from choosing the model to fine-tune and release. Early fine-tuning pilots can use reviewed data from the existing generation process." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#fff7e6, #332d24);strokeColor=light-dark(#e2c88f, #7c8da1);align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontSize=16;fontColor=light-dark(#6a5330, #e6edf3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1155" y="1045" width="530" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="week-footer" value="Deadline: October 18, 2026 · Week labels follow the proposed sprint; calendar boundaries and detailed task assignments remain open.&lt;br&gt;Fine-tuning and snapshot GPU work: Vast.ai. Public endpoint: rented hosting, provisionally six months. This draft authorizes no work to begin." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=light-dark(#45566c, #bac6d3);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="1315" width="1630" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
